{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1000_p", "source_sha256": "769b780a6646dd910e947c813189d211744c224fe2deccfce187a55255ee36a4", "ja": "（『アイドルスペースウォーズ』の最新作は大好評。\n劇場のアイドル達の評価も高まっている！）", "zh": "（《偶像太空大战》最新作大获好评。\n剧场偶像们的评价也越来越高了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "e2fb9e3bf73761c93bae2f44a857efefa5cf4777cffd7e0ef9654696dfb76ab5", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさんです。\n映画、評判いいみたいだねぇ！　えへへ。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦。电影的评价好像很不错呢！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6262f2727b0655b24b351f70c7744bdc45c651ebf9fed343632bd02ae877f280", "ja": "お疲れさま！　そうなんだよ。\nひなたやみんなが、頑張ってくれたおかげだな。", "zh": "辛苦了！是啊。\n多亏了日向和大家努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "e843717c2c8b5a524a0797f618d0c53305107dc8ea3e975723684c3522876ae9", "ja": "なんもなんも！\nあたしなんて、ついていくのがやっとだったし。", "zh": "没什么没什么！\n我也只是勉强跟上而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1004_p", "source_sha256": "23beafcbec585e1841346e720ca3df7a0c5f29e7206eef071eb409fa9f8ccc57", "ja": "そんな風には見えなかったよ。\nひなたの演技、迫力があってバッチリだったぞ！", "zh": "看不出来哦。\n小日向的演技气势十足，棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "3367c4964bcb5985e5b638338ee7b7c1919bb7f1190199f5ece98df4b84b9cfa", "ja": "本当かい？　だったら嬉しいなぁ……。\n映画の中のあたしは、強くてカッコイイよねぇ。", "zh": "真的吗？那我可高兴了……  \n电影里的我，又坚强又帅气，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "85537ae86b1a7cda4b5388a552622ea1c96938fdb47ad201d878fb184f1ce76f", "ja": "役を演じながら、悩んだこともあったけども……。\nでも、色んなことを教えてもらったんだぁ。", "zh": "演这个角色的时候，虽然也有过烦恼……\n不过，我也从中学到了好多东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1007_p", "source_sha256": "937497f345493b4328fe912f59b4ec8912d87bf2a1428a8736892aa512f20d22", "ja": "色んなこと？　たとえばどんな？", "zh": "各种事？比如说哪些？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "927a77056dcb0112cce4d1dfedb01145bb42d16a31a262419abbeb8c698b03b2", "ja": "うんとね、映画の中のヒナタって、\n最初はあたしに似た性格の子だったっしょや？", "zh": "那个啊，电影里的日向，最开始是个和我性格很像的孩子，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "bf24d3c6ffacff81093cb5bb18a546644d24b870ad2dcacacadd4ded1204f81e", "ja": "でも、大切な人を守りたいからって、\n強くなっていって……性格も、変わってしまって。", "zh": "但是，因为想保护重要的人，她逐渐变强了……性格也随之改变了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ba5a7a0f97e8d0d5d2d8fff8d84ff45923486bd4eb9a4e67d0c9159e666d1ad7", "ja": "そうだな。クイーン・エミリーを守りたい\n一心で、強くなったんだよな。", "zh": "是啊。为了保护艾米莉女王，一心想变强，结果真的变强了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "682eee4a7a06871abe43d41a56f2777d72b0b7d7ed504981531fb4ce580700c7", "ja": "うん。それであたし、思ったんだわ。\n強くなるのって、なんだか寂しいなぁって。", "zh": "嗯。所以俺就在想啊。\n变强这件事，总觉得有些让人寂寞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "e526da2964b5cbd5d88bbc56b5e119bfe1149288a99631bbc2b4a1c2aa518cdb", "ja": "あたしも、アイドルとしてまだまだだけども……\nいつか有名になったら、変わってしまうんだろか？", "zh": "我作为偶像也还差得远呢……不过，要是哪天出名了，也会变得不一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1013_p", "source_sha256": "dab7854248421205d007f7b54ca3589785673569c714624afdd3ab47331442c3", "ja": "そうかもな……でも、もしそうだとしても、\nあまり気にしなくてもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "或许吧……不过，就算真是那样，也不用太在意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "2969581303ae0e44dae1126b50c98141a9f87de46ac5ae9138664a16a8945302", "ja": "え？　どうして？", "zh": "咦？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5050388fc56aaad6368aeacabfd1b7dd7e2db1e22d3fc9396ee2f137f47721b2", "ja": "人は、どうしても変わってしまうものだから。\n大切なのは、いい方向に変わるかどうかだと思うよ。", "zh": "因为人总是会改变的。\n重要的是，是否会朝着好的方向改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fbd3698eab78fce70b7b818068f718288e149bade1c63c3a15ffea7d5bfa4ab1", "ja": "ひなたが悪い方向にいきそうになったときは、\nちゃんと教えるから、大丈夫。", "zh": "当ひなた似乎要往不好的方向发展时，我会好好提醒她的，放心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "c588450014706719ce6557700a52767aa23852671373ee2976e55a10e760dca2", "ja": "えへへ……そっかぁ。\n{$P$}がいてくれたら、安心だなぁ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……这样啊。\n有{$P$}在的话，就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0383_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "d58e167a0bba62916b5a3f16d4b3732c6db8a165c9d7f3070d4226adc4da98a1", "ja": "したっけ、いつかそんな日が来る日まで、\nよろしくねぇ？　{$P$}！", "zh": "那在那一天到来之前，就拜托你啦？{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
